  "definition": "Total recorded length in kilometres of Class C rural roads in each county in 2025, using the published Total column in KNBS Economic Survey 2026 Table 11.9. The table attributes the data to the Kenya Rural Roads Authority and states that the 2025 increase largely reflects the 2025 Road Inventory and Condition Surveys identifying and mapping previously unmapped roads.",
  "scope_note": "Class C rural roads are a fixed road class and are not the entire road network located within a county. The original Atlas placeholder 'Classified road length' is broader/ambiguous, so P21 promotes this series only as a separately named successor and does not describe it as total county road length.",
  "rounding_note": "The Atlas preserves the table's published Total field verbatim. At one-decimal display precision, some county totals differ by 0.1 km from the displayed paved plus unpaved components, and displayed county totals sum to 28,150.5 km versus the published national total of 28,149.9 km. No balancing, recalculation or residual allocation is applied. Dash entries in paved/unpaved component fields are retained as null rather than inferred as zero; all 47 published Total values are numeric.",
  "publication_note": "Economic Survey 2026 was launched on 29 April 2026. Table 11.9 marks 2025 values provisional. The annual 2025 reference period is used because the publication does not state county-specific RICS observation dates.",
